"menggunakan tipe koleksi abstrak seperti :class:`~collections.abc.Sequence` "
"atau :class:`~collections.abc.Iterable` daripada menggunakan :class:`list` "
"atau :class:`!typing.List`."

msgid ""
":class:`builtins.list <list>` now supports subscripting (``[]``). "
"See :pep:`585` and :ref:`types-genericalias`."
msgstr ""
":class:`builtins.list <list>` kini mendukung subscripting (``[]``). "
"Lihat :pep:`585` dan :ref:`types-genericalias`."

msgid "Deprecated alias to :class:`builtins.set <set>`."
msgstr ""
