msgstr ""
":class:`builtins.frozenset <frozenset>` kini mendukung subscripting "
"(``[]``). Lihat :pep:`585` dan :ref:`types-genericalias`."

msgid "Deprecated alias for :class:`tuple`."
msgstr "Alias yang sudah tidak disarankan lagi untuk :class:`tuple`."

msgid ""
":class:`tuple` and ``Tuple`` are special-cased in the type system; "
"see :ref:`annotating-tuples` for more details."
msgstr ""
":class:`tuple` dan ``Tuple`` diperlakukan secara khusus dalam sistem tipe; "
"lihat :ref:`annotating-tuples` untuk detail lebih lanjut."

msgid ""
":class:`builtins.tuple <tuple>` now supports subscripting (``[]``). "
"See :pep:`585` and :ref:`types-genericalias`."
msgstr ""
":class:`builtins.tuple <tuple>` kini mendukung subscripting (``[]``). "
"Lihat :pep:`585` dan :ref:`types-genericalias`."

msgid "Deprecated alias to :class:`type`."
msgstr "Alias yang sudah tidak disarankan lagi untuk :class:`type`."

msgid ""
"See :ref:`type-of-class-objects` for details on using :class:`type` or "
"``typing.Type`` in type annotations."
msgstr ""
"Lihat :ref:`type-of-class-objects` untuk detail tentang "
"penggunaan :class:`type` atau ``typing.Type`` dalam anotasi tipe."

msgid ""
":class:`builtins.type <type>` now supports subscripting (``[]``). "
