msgstr ""
":class:`builtins.type <type>` kini mendukung subscripting (``[]``). "
"Lihat :pep:`585` dan :ref:`types-genericalias`."

msgid "Aliases to types in :mod:`collections`"
msgstr "Alias untuk tipe di :mod:`collections`"

msgid "Deprecated alias to :class:`collections.defaultdict`."
msgstr ""
"Alias yang sudah tidak disarankan lagi "
"untuk :class:`collections.defaultdict`."

msgid ""
":class:`collections.defaultdict` now supports subscripting (``[]``). "
